4.7.5. Off-Street Parking Lot Buffer: The purpose of this buffer is to screen vehicular parking areas from adjacent properties and street rights-of-way.
A. Applicability:
1. An Off-Street Parking Lot Buffer shall be required where a parking lot containing four or more parking spaces adjoins other properties or where a parking lot abuts a public or private road right-of-way.
2. An Off-Street Parking Lot Buffer shall not be required where a Use Buffer is required, or in areas designated for the display of vehicles for sales, rental, or leasing purposes.
